0 Bloom - expanding angulated-scissor sphere
0 Name: bloom.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/bloom.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Bloom design assembled from stock parts with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel export through the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author field is the serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Three mutually perpendicular 8-cell rings; 48 rigid angulated links.
0 // All references are unmodified stock parts. No scripted output poses or custom physics.
0 // Companion: bloom.bw. Robot Lab: Plain, open model, Pause > Reset > Run.
0 // Reset the complete model before repeating; the controller uses this saved encoder datum.
0 // Physical hardware construction remains untested.
